       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-STANAG-NEURAL-MESH-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STANAG-NEURAL-MESH.
           05  WS-STANAG-FRAME-HEADER      PIC X(08) VALUE "STANAG45".
           05  WS-NEURON-NODE-COUNT        PIC 9(04) VALUE 0256.
           05  WS-WEYL-ALGEBRA-COMPLETE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VFIO-DMA-PACKET-SYNC     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STANAG-4586-ROUTING      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WMQ-SCSI-CHANNEL-ID      PIC 9(03) VALUE 018.
       01  WS-STANAG-PROOF-FLAGS.
           05  WS-FRAME-CHECKSUM-MET       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIP-SYNAPSE-ALIGNED      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MESH-DEADLOCK-FREE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FINAL-STANAG-PROOF-CODE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-WEYL-STANAG-LINK.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-VFIO-SYNAPSE-ROUTING.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-DEADLOCK-FREEDOM.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-STANAG-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-WEYL-STANAG-LINK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FRAME-CHECKSUM-MET.
       2000-VERIFY-VFIO-SYNAPSE-ROUTING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIP-SYNAPSE-ALIGNED.
       3000-VERIFY-DEADLOCK-FREEDOM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MESH-DEADLOCK-FREE.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-STANAG-PROOF.
           IF WS-FRAME-CHECKSUM-MET = 1 AND
              WS-LIP-SYNAPSE-ALIGNED = 1 AND
              WS-MESH-DEADLOCK-FREE = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-ALGEBRA-COMPLETE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FINAL-STANAG-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FINAL-STANAG-PROOF-CODE.
